{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_046_02_b",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:4309172761dd7b4384cf581b690cd46f02823d79045967e579f5d1cbeca10b75",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:80428e3de7c93d8f930d8e637c1e894e3b5f6145a004ce408b7c8e7a94a5b9b2",
      "text": "（哎呀。克里斯先生已经回复了～。\n今年肯定也泡在海里吧～。问问看吧～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ee4bb388661322d166eefe041ae9eef0eef3a1623e7864a4cdbe31d1793ffb1",
      "text": "（“早上好～。你现在在海边吗～？”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3513deeb5bf96953b0e179fcf51a70a0b988c5a0a9f741c9169cf03484a8760f",
      "text": "（果然在海边啊～。啊，照片发过来了。\n克里斯先生就算过生日也和平时没两样呢～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:76f9cb0156ec06245238cbd20deba305a39da85ac796c567b8630cfe537359c6",
      "text": "（回复一句“大海的照片，谢谢啦～”吧。今天稍微有些\n忙，得尽早行动起来才行了～）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000092:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7d9e83aa9ceff81365aca00b13170561c0d97784446ecb5712811a8202db0036",
      "text": "雨彦的房间",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000107:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cd3d4d09f322988eb517277589f1074568f80cce3b5fe8771366c536cea231df",
      "text": "嗯？……是古论啊。看来注意到信息了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000111:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:37c4fc494237b8ae631a311e9dd2225580c9a3517994c5094255e9a45962b701",
      "text": "嚯，在海边啊。\n很有古论风格的过生日方式。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000118:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:393cd8e8b5f5f5aa29eb48a3ce3020493c072bfa22baaf20d0a4c5add54a382d",
      "text": "（“真是漂亮的大海照片啊。天气不错，\n真是再好不过了”）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_046chr_02_1_2_046_02:1_2_046_02_b:cmd-000132:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8249aee3935e72c21ccbbdbb3ec8e3af96f80c4c3175049b13a6a68cf08a6a40",
      "text": "……好啦，打扫也做完了，\n差不多该准备出门了。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
